---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Affiliate Disclosure | VideoEditChoice"
	description="Learn about our affiliate relationships and how we maintain editorial independence."
>
	<article class="legal-page">
		<h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

		<section>
			<h2>Overview</h2>
			<p>
				VideoEditChoice participates in affiliate marketing programs. This means that we may earn a
				commission when you click on certain links and make a purchase, at no additional cost to you.
			</p>
			<p>
				This disclosure is provided in accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's guidelines on
				endorsements and testimonials.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
			<p>
				Affiliate links are special URLs that allow us to earn a small commission when you purchase
				a product or service after clicking through from our site.
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Important:</strong> Using our affiliate links does not increase the price you pay.
				In many cases, you may even get a special discount or bonus.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>How We Choose Products to Recommend</h2>
			<p>
				Our recommendations are based on what's actually useful for beginners, not what pays the
				highest commission.
			</p>
			<p>
				Evidence of this:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>We frequently recommend completely free software (DaVinci Resolve, CapCut, Shotcut)</li>
				<li>We tell you who should NOT use certain software</li>
				<li>We warn about realistic learning curves and PC requirements</li>
				<li>We prioritize beginner success over expensive tools</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				If we wouldn't recommend a tool to our own family members learning video editing, we don't
				recommend it on this site, regardless of commission potential.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Types of Affiliate Programs</h2>
			<p>
				We may participate in affiliate programs with:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Software companies (Adobe, Filmora, etc.)</li>
				<li>Online course platforms</li>
				<li>Amazon Associates (for recommended equipment)</li>
				<li>Other relevant services for video editors</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Editorial Independence</h2>
			<p>
				We maintain complete editorial independence. Here's what this means:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>No software company can pay for positive reviews</li>
				<li>We write honest pros and cons for every tool</li>
				<li>We don't remove negative information for commission potential</li>
				<li>Our recommendations are based on beginner success rates</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>When We Don't Use Affiliate Links</h2>
			<p>
				Not all links on this site are affiliate links. In many cases, we link to:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Free software download pages (with no affiliate program)</li>
				<li>Educational resources and tutorials</li>
				<li>Official documentation and guides</li>
				<li>Community forums and support pages</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>How Affiliate Commissions Support This Site</h2>
			<p>
				Affiliate commissions help us:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Keep the site free for all visitors</li>
				<li>Create more in-depth guides and comparisons</li>
				<li>Test software on different computer specs</li>
				<li>Maintain and update existing content</li>
				<li>Cover hosting and operational costs</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Your Trust Matters</h2>
			<p>
				We take your trust seriously. If you ever feel that our recommendations are influenced by
				affiliate commissions rather than genuine usefulness, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
			</p>
			<p>
				We're committed to maintaining the integrity of our recommendations and putting beginner success first.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Questions?</h2>
			<p>
				If you have questions about our affiliate relationships or how we make recommendations,
				please visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
			</p>
		</section>

		<p class="last-updated">
			<em>Last updated: January 2024</em>
		</p>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.legal-page {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.legal-page h1 {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
	}

	.legal-page section {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.legal-page h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		color: #111;
	}

	.legal-page ul {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.legal-page li {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.last-updated {
		margin-top: 4rem;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
		color: #666;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
</style>
